{"metadata":{"title":"Using the Swidux Agent Skill","modules":[{"name":"Swidux"}],"role":"article","roleHeading":"Article"},"kind":"article","primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Overview","anchor":"Overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Swidux ships a companion agent skill ("},{"code":"swidux-ref","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":") for AI coding assistants like Claude Code. It contains the architecture rules, conventions, and code templates an assistant needs to generate correct Swidux code without you re-explaining the patterns."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The skill is published in ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"https:\/\/github.com\/heirloomlogic\/skills"},{"type":"text","text":" — Heirloom Logic’s public skills repo — alongside any future Heirloom skills. Two files:"}]},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"SKILL.md","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" — architecture rules (the 10 rules, the dispatch lifecycle, plugin shapes, anti-patterns)."}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"code":"swidux-patterns.md","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" — copy-pasteable code templates for ","type":"text"},{"code":"AppState","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AppAction"},{"type":"text","text":", reducers, "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AppStore"},{"text":" factory, views, plugin wiring, and Swift Testing reducer tests.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"anchor":"Installing-the-skill","text":"Installing the skill","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"anchor":"GitHub-CLI-recommended","text":"GitHub CLI (recommended)","level":3,"type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Requires ","type":"text"},{"code":"gh","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" ≥ v2.90.0 (","type":"text"},{"identifier":"https:\/\/cli.github.com","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":").","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"bash","code":["gh skill install heirloomlogic\/skills swidux-ref --agent claude-code --scope user"]},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"code":"--scope user","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" installs to "},{"code":"~\/.claude\/skills\/swidux-ref\/","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" (loads in every project)."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"code":"--scope project","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" installs to ","type":"text"},{"code":"<cwd>\/.claude\/skills\/swidux-ref\/","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" (commit it so the whole team gets it)."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Pin a version with "},{"code":"swidux-ref@v1.2.3","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":". List tags with "},{"code":"git ls-remote --tags https:\/\/github.com\/heirloomlogic\/skills","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Other agents: pass "},{"code":"--agent codex","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"code":"--agent cursor","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"code":"--agent gemini-cli","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", etc. Run "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"gh skill install --help"},{"type":"text","text":" for the full list."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"type":"heading","text":"skills.sh","level":3,"anchor":"skillssh"},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"bash","code":["npx skillsadd heirloomlogic\/skills"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Indexes the same source repo. Works without a GitHub CLI install."}]},{"type":"heading","level":3,"text":"Manual (no `gh`, no `npx`)","anchor":"Manual-no-gh-no-npx"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Claude Code uses "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".claude\/skills\/"},{"type":"text","text":". Codex, Cursor, Gemini CLI, and others use "},{"code":".agents\/skills\/","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":". Pick the directory that matches your agent:"}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"bash","code":["# Claude Code — project install","mkdir -p .claude\/skills && \\","  curl -fsSL https:\/\/github.com\/heirloomlogic\/skills\/archive\/refs\/heads\/main.tar.gz | \\","  tar -xz --strip-components=2 -C .claude\/skills skills-main\/swidux-ref","","# Codex \/ Cursor \/ Gemini CLI — project install","mkdir -p .agents\/skills && \\","  curl -fsSL https:\/\/github.com\/heirloomlogic\/skills\/archive\/refs\/heads\/main.tar.gz | \\","  tar -xz --strip-components=2 -C .agents\/skills skills-main\/swidux-ref"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Swap "},{"code":".claude\/skills","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" \/ "},{"code":".agents\/skills","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" for "},{"code":"~\/.claude\/skills","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" etc. for a user-wide install. "},{"code":"tar","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" overwrites by default, so re-running either command updates the skill in place. To pin a version, replace "},{"code":"main","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" in the URL with the tag name (e.g. "},{"code":"swidux-ref@v1.0.0","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":")."}]},{"type":"heading","level":3,"text":"Loading content directly (assistants without a skill loader)","anchor":"Loading-content-directly-assistants-without-a-skill-loader"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The skill files are plain Markdown. Point your assistant’s system prompt or rules file at:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"https:\/\/raw.githubusercontent.com\/heirloomlogic\/skills\/main\/swidux-ref\/SKILL.md"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"https:\/\/raw.githubusercontent.com\/heirloomlog